  (text "ROTARY SWITCH (off-board, J3): 1 pole x 3 positions, NON-SHORTING (break-before-make).\nJ3-1 = COM (+12V)   J3-2 = POS 1 (3.3 V)   J3-3 = POS 2 (5 V)   J3-4 = POS 3 (12 V).\nBetween positions every M1..M3 line is low -> VAL low -> comparator pulls RESET low -> 555 and PMOS OFF.\nEach position enables ONLY its own RA / RB / preload branch (no parallel combination of networks)." (at 16.0000 558.8800 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c6cf45f7-e427-4341-8d3d-27d083145c8e"))
  (text "POWER PATH: MOSFET ON : +15V -> R3 -> M1 -> SW -> L1 -> VOUT -> load -> GND.   MOSFET OFF: GND -> D11 -> SW -> L1 -> VOUT -> load (freewheel).\nOPEN-LOOP converter: Vout ~ D x Vin. Calibrated targets 3.3 / 5 / 12 V at 10 ohm, 15 V in. NOT a regulated output." (at 16.0000 708.9000 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3ce67537-72e8-4f23-aeae-63a976ee26a9"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
